        <mxCell id="node-trip" value="&lt;b&gt;Trip / Ride Service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;Lifecycle: requested -&amp;gt; matched -&amp;gt; in-progress -&amp;gt; completed&lt;/small&gt;"
